      "@id": "https://api.nuget.org/v3/catalog0/data/2026.06.01.07.29.40/system.reactive.windows.threading.6.1.0.json#deprecation/alternatePackage",
      "id": "System.Reactive.WindowsRuntime",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This package once provided a single place from which you could get [Core]Dispatcher support for whichever Windows UI framework you happened to be building for, and it is now a slightly confusing relic of how the Windows (and Windows Phone) UI framework landscape looked in the early to mid 2010s. Developers should now pick a package that provides the UI framework support they require, e.g. System.Reactive.WindowsRuntime for the Windows runtime CoreDispatcher, or System.Reactive.Wpf for WPF's Dispatcher support.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
